0);\"><br></span></span></font></span></font></span></div></pre><p class=\"0\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; text-wrap: wrap; padding-top: 0px; text-align: center; line-height: 1.5;\"><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; text-wrap: wrap; padding-top: 0px; text-align: center; line-height: 1.5;\"></p><pre style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; line-height: 1.62rem; overflow: auto;\"><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"padding: 10px; line-height: 1.5; word-break: break-all; border-style: double; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(121, 165, 228); background-color: rgb(219, 232, 251);\"><p style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; text-wrap: wrap; line-height: 1.5; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><b>주요 참고사항</b></span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; text-wrap: wrap; padding-top: 0px; line-height: 1.5; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-size:14pt;\">1.</span><a href=\"https://dorm.kumoh.ac.kr/dorm/sub0401.do?mode=view&amp;articleNo=422765&amp;article.offset=0&amp;articleLimit=10&amp;srSearchVal=%EC%8B%9D%EC%82%AC%EB%B3%80%EA%B2%BD&amp;srSearchKey=article_title\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"tx-link\" style=\"color: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"> </span></a><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><a href=\"https://dorm.kumoh.ac.kr/dorm/sub0401.do?mode=view&amp;articleNo=422765&amp;article.offset=0&amp;articleLimit=10&amp;srSearchVal=%EC%8B%9D%EC%82%AC%EB%B3%80%EA%B2%BD&amp;srSearchKey=article_title\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"tx-link\" style=\"color: inherit;\">